OQ7Prescribed.normalizedIncidentDrive_norm : ∀ (k : ℝ) (B : OQ7Prescribed.TwoLayerBody) (σ : OQ7Prescribed.Direction),
  ‖OQ7Prescribed.normalizedIncidentDrive k B σ‖ = B.aperture * √B.plateThickness
OQ7Prescribed.normalizedIncidentDrive_separated : ∀ (k : ℝ) (B : OQ7Prescribed.TwoLayerBody)
  (σ : OQ7Prescribed.Direction),
  ↑↑↑(OQ7Prescribed.normalizedIncidentDrive k B σ) =ᵐ[MeasureTheory.volume]
