  Set.Ioo 0 1 • Subtype.val '' ⇑(OQ7Prescribed.orthogonalSphere e) ⁻¹' s = ⇑e ⁻¹' (Set.Ioo 0 1 • Subtype.val '' s)
OQ7Prescribed.orthogonalSphere_measurePreserving : ∀ (e : OQ7Prescribed.Position ≃ₗᵢ[ℝ] OQ7Prescribed.Position),
